{"page":545,"verses":[{"verse_key":"58:22","surah":58,"ayah":22,"ar_uthmani":"لَّا تَجِدُ قَوْمًا يُؤْمِنُونَ بِٱللَّهِ وَٱلْيَوْمِ ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ يُوَآدُّونَ مَنْ حَآدَّ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ وَلَوْ كَانُوٓا۟ ءَابَآءَهُمْ أَوْ أَبْنَآءَهُمْ أَوْ إِخْوَٰنَهُمْ أَوْ عَشِيرَتَهُمْ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ كَتَبَ فِى قُلُوبِهِمُ ٱلْإِيمَـٰنَ وَأَيَّدَهُم بِرُوحٍ مِّنْهُ ۖ وَيُدْخِلُهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ رَضِىَ ٱللَّهُ عَنْهُمْ وَرَضُوا۟ عَنْهُ ۚ أُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ حِزْبُ ٱللَّهِ ۚ أَلَآ إِنَّ حِزْبَ ٱللَّهِ هُمُ ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], you will not find people who truly believe in God and the Last Day giving their loyalty to those who oppose God and His Messenger, even though they may be their fathers, sons, brothers, or other relations: these are the people in whose hearts God has inscribed faith, and whom He has strengthened with His spirit. He will let them enter Gardens graced with flowing streams, where they will stay: God is well pleased with them, and they with Him. They are on God’s side, and God’s side will be the one to prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"You will not find","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَجِدُ","en_gloss":"You will not find","transliteration":"tajidu","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":3,"ar":"قَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a people","transliteration":"qawman","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"who believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":5,"ar":"بِٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"in Allah","transliteration":"bil-lahi","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَٱلْيَوْمِ","en_gloss":"and the Day","transliteration":"wal-yawmi","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلْـَٔاخِرِ","en_gloss":"the Last","transliteration":"l-ākhiri","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":8,"ar":"يُوَآدُّونَ","en_gloss":"loving","transliteration":"yuwāddūna","verse_key":"58:22"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَنْ","en_gloss":"(those) who","transliteration":"man",